Welcome back to the puzzler, the gelatinous yeast in your kombucha scoby.
欢迎回到《The Puzzler》，你康普茶红茶菌里的明胶状酵母。

00:21:38.279 --> 00:21:40.880
Oh, God.
噢，天哪。

